<title>JAPAN: Toyo Kanetsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Kanetsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.57		vs	   19.50</p>
<p> Operating   loss 193    million    vs	prft 848 million</p>
<p> Current	    295    million    vs	    1.17</p>
<p> Net		  256    million    vs	  505    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.82 yen	  vs	    3.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    142 million	  vs	 140 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Kanetsu Co Ltd is a storage tank builder. Its net was down 49.3 pct.</p>
